// Rclone Copying Data
// Sigma rule: rules/sigma/windows/win_rclone_data_transfer.yml (9b52a179-bf36-48f5-bc46-39702df48bd6)
// Level: medium. ATT&CK: T1567.002 Exfiltration to Cloud Storage
// Generated by `python -m detlab build`. Change the Sigma rule, not this file.
any where (event.provider:"Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon" and event.code:"1") and ((process.executable:"*\\rclone.exe" or process.pe.original_file_name:"rclone.exe") and (process.command_line like~ ("* copy *", "* sync *", "* move *")))
